ORC-USBQO7PI2L,GE-SE,TRANSITION_TEMPERATURE,phase transition,,running_text,420.0,K,,,,16.0,16.0,unknown,420.0,420 K,101325,βGeSe2; αGeSe2,,βGeSe2 → αGeSe2,,experimental,,true,doi:10.1007/s11664-022-09474-1,10.1007/s11664-022-09474-1,"Shanxiong Chen, Jiong Wang, Shangzhao Yu, Biao Hu, Qing Wu, Yong Du, Thermodynamic Modeling of the Ge-X (X = As, Se, S, P) Systems, J. Electron. Mater. 51, 2114-2130 (2022).",p. 5,5,"They observed that the λ-type phase transition βGeSe2 → αGeSe2 occurred at 420 K, and αGeSe2 is the low-temperature phase and βGeSe2 is the high-temperature phase."
